Subtask 4.3: Create Tokens with Different Policies
Create tokens associated with different policies:

# Create a read-only token
READONLY_TOKEN=$(vault token create -policy="readonly-policy" -format=json | jq -r '.auth.client_token')
echo "Read-only token: $READONLY_TOKEN"

# Create a developer token
DEVELOPER_TOKEN=$(vault token create -policy="developer-policy" -format=json | jq -r '.auth.client_token')
echo "Developer token: $DEVELOPER_TOKEN"

# Create an admin token
ADMIN_TOKEN=$(vault token create -policy="admin-policy" -format=json | jq -r '.auth.client_token')
echo "Admin token: $ADMIN_TOKEN"

# Save tokens to file for reference
