Task 6: Advanced Policy Features
Subtask 6.1: Create Policy with Path Templating
Create a policy using templating for user-specific paths:

# Create user-specific policy
cat > policies/user-specific-policy.hcl << 'EOF'
# Allow users to access their own secrets
path "secret/data/users/{{identity.entity.name}}/*" {
  capabilities = ["create", "read", "update", "delete", "list"]
}

# Allow users to list their own path
path "secret/metadata/users/{{identity.entity.name}}" {
  capabilities = ["list"]
}

# Standard token operations
path "auth/token/lookup-self" {
  capabilities = ["read"]
}

path "auth/token/renew-self" {
  capabilities = ["update"]
}
EOF

# Load the templated policy
vault policy write user-specific-policy policies/user-specific-policy.hcl
Subtask 6.2: Create Policy with Conditions
Create a policy with conditional access:

# Create conditional policy
cat > policies/conditional-policy.hcl << 'EOF'
# Time-based access (example - requires Vault Enterprise for full functionality)
path "secret/data/time-sensitive/*" {
  capabilities = ["read"]
  # This is a basic example - advanced conditions require Vault Enterprise
}

# IP-based restrictions (basic example)
path "secret/data/restricted/*" {
  capabilities = ["read", "list"]
  # Note: Advanced IP restrictions require Vault Enterprise
}

# Standard capabilities
path "auth/token/lookup-self" {
  capabilities = ["read"]
}
EOF

# Load the conditional policy
vault policy write conditional-policy policies/conditional-policy.hcl
Subtask 6.3: Create Policy with Deny Rules
Create a policy that explicitly denies certain operations:

# Create policy with deny rules
cat > policies/deny-example-policy.hcl << 'EOF'
# Allow broad read access
path "secret/data/*" {
  capabilities = ["read", "list"]
}

# Explicitly deny access to sensitive paths
path "secret/data/sensitive/*" {
  capabilities = ["deny"]
}

# Allow most operations on user data but deny delete
path "secret/data/user-data/*" {
  capabilities = ["create", "read", "update", "list"]
}

path "secret/data/user-data/*" {
  capabilities = ["deny"]
  denied_parameters = {
    "delete" = []
  }
}
EOF

# Load the deny policy
vault policy write deny-example-policy policies/deny-example-policy.hcl
