Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue: Policy not taking effect immediately

Solution: Tokens cache policy information. Create a new token or wait for token renewal.
Issue: "Permission denied" errors when testing

Solution: Verify you're using the correct token and that the policy paths match exactly.
Issue: Policy syntax errors

Solution: Use vault policy fmt policy-file.hcl to format and validate syntax.
Issue: Cannot access secrets after applying policy

Solution: Check that the policy includes necessary capabilities and the correct path format.
Validation Commands
# Validate policy syntax
vault policy fmt policies/policy-name.hcl

# Check current token capabilities
vault token capabilities secret/data/path

# Lookup token information
vault token lookup

# Test specific path access
vault kv get secret/data/test/path
